{"from": "text:tobit-5-wages", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-20-02-denarius-a-day", "note": "Cross-reference: Tobit offers his son's guide 'wages, a drachm every day' - a hired man's wage fixed per day in a Second Temple-era Jewish story (verse 5:9 in Sefaria's edition, commonly cited as 5:14)."}
{"from": "text:leviticus-19-13", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-20-08-pay-same-day", "note": "Cross-reference: 'The wages of a hired servant shall not remain with you all night until the morning.'"}
