{"from": "claim:mt-20-02-denarius-a-day", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-18-28-hundred-denarii", "note": "The denarius as a day's wage links the ch 18 debt parable (100 denarii) to the vineyard day-wage here; the ch 18 lead pointed this chapter."}
{"from": "site:herodian-jericho-palaces", "type": "identified_as", "to": "place:jericho", "note": "The Herodian winter palaces and their garden city are the New Testament Jericho of Matt 20:29, on both banks of Wadi Qelt, separate from the Old Testament tell (Tell es-Sultan)."}
